WEBVTT

00:04.030 --> 00:07.660
Stop, you'll harm my lab!

00:09.300 --> 00:12.110
So, it was impossible after all.

00:12.110 --> 00:14.910
That's the strongest of the key spirits for you.

00:15.680 --> 00:18.650
I killed her.

00:19.680 --> 00:22.980
I killed Karen.

00:41.640 --> 00:49.240
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:49.240 --> 00:52.410
Utatte iru

00:52.410 --> 01:00.060
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:00.060 --> 01:03.320
Shimaikonde

01:03.320 --> 01:13.900
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:13.900 --> 01:19.340
Ayumou

01:19.340 --> 01:24.750
Susumou

01:24.750 --> 01:29.580
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:29.580 --> 01:35.060
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:35.060 --> 01:40.530
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:40.530 --> 01:45.770
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:45.770 --> 01:49.790
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:51.440 --> 01:54.970
Atashi wa ikite yuku

01:59.750 --> 02:03.620
Episode 42
A Small Savior

02:15.430 --> 02:17.970
Good work, Sara.

02:17.970 --> 02:21.740
There was no need for me to take part.

02:21.740 --> 02:24.210
Ulvarx's system was destroyed,

02:24.210 --> 02:28.110
and instead of falling into Tuskan hands,
it vanished into the depths of the sea.

02:28.110 --> 02:31.240
Because of the people from Templar?

02:31.910 --> 02:33.540
Yes.

02:37.150 --> 02:41.450
We are about to hold Lady Sagiri's
holy ceremony.

02:42.020 --> 02:45.150
You are to be a member of Seekers.

02:46.130 --> 02:48.360
You should attend as well.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.990
I shall.

02:57.570 --> 03:00.540
Lady Sagiri, go forward.

03:01.880 --> 03:04.170
Go, Lady Sagiri.

03:24.500 --> 03:27.130
I can't see anything.

03:28.070 --> 03:31.370
Hey, what should I do?

03:32.610 --> 03:34.400
Is someone here?

03:49.560 --> 03:52.090
Who are you?

03:52.090 --> 03:54.890
Shadin...

03:57.200 --> 04:00.170
Shadin...

04:02.670 --> 04:04.640
You have a funny face.

04:06.510 --> 04:09.140
I'm Sagiri.

04:09.610 --> 04:12.510
So, your name is Shadin, huh?

04:12.510 --> 04:14.310
Nice to meet you, Shadin!

04:14.750 --> 04:17.380
Shadin...

04:40.810 --> 04:43.940
Our savior is born.

04:49.750 --> 04:50.420
Lady Sagiri!

04:50.420 --> 04:51.720
Lady Sagiri!
Lady Sagiri!

04:55.920 --> 05:01.830
So, after Neotopia, even Ulvarx fell to Tusk?

05:01.830 --> 05:09.500
We did prevent the worst-case scenario of
Tusk obtaining their technology, but...

05:09.500 --> 05:13.300
I wonder if Zed and Roya's actions
were really for the best?

05:15.210 --> 05:17.450
I seriously question that.

05:17.450 --> 05:21.120
Didn't they actually provoke Tusk?

05:21.120 --> 05:25.620
Talking about that will accomplish nothing now.

05:25.620 --> 05:27.260
Zico...

05:27.260 --> 05:29.720
This is a fruitless discussion.

05:30.730 --> 05:35.200
Why is Tusk making moves now?

05:35.200 --> 05:39.100
What we need to do is figure out their motives.

05:39.100 --> 05:40.840
You're a fine one to talk!

05:40.840 --> 05:45.800
You were once voracious in the
search for power yourself!

05:50.610 --> 05:52.680
Thanks for your patronage!

05:52.680 --> 05:54.820
Thank you!

05:54.820 --> 05:57.220
Hey, I'll take three of these.

05:57.220 --> 05:59.350
Right, please wait one moment.

06:03.460 --> 06:08.760
In the end, we couldn't save anyone.

06:10.730 --> 06:13.700
I wonder where Ginga went?

06:18.070 --> 06:20.170
Amir Gaul, go back!

06:20.170 --> 06:22.380
Ginga is still back there!

06:22.380 --> 06:24.000
Amir Gaul!

06:25.080 --> 06:28.380
He must be all right, don't you think, Zed?

06:30.590 --> 06:32.550
I don't know.

06:46.730 --> 06:48.360
Sara...

06:49.570 --> 06:52.840
So, here you are again.

06:52.840 --> 06:56.970
Why don't you just forget about the past already?

06:57.680 --> 07:01.280
I couldn't even if I wanted to.

07:01.280 --> 07:05.320
My hands are still stained with blood,

07:05.320 --> 07:08.990
with blood I couldn't wash off
if I washed them forever.

07:08.990 --> 07:10.620
Zico...

07:22.600 --> 07:25.730
Lady Sagiri, you're awake?

07:26.610 --> 07:28.040
I...

07:28.040 --> 07:33.450
You became tired after receiving the holy power.

07:33.450 --> 07:37.550
Congratulations, my lady savior!

07:37.550 --> 07:39.520
Savior?

07:42.220 --> 07:43.590
That's right.

07:43.590 --> 07:48.050
You have become the savior of
the Seekers, Lady Sagiri.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.600
I'm thirsty.

07:51.600 --> 07:54.170
All right, please wait just a moment.

07:54.170 --> 07:56.970
I'll bring you some food as well.

07:57.870 --> 08:00.170
I'm sure you're hungry too.

08:08.150 --> 08:13.110
Am I a savior too, just like Noah?

08:19.090 --> 08:23.230
With this spirit, I can fight too.

08:23.230 --> 08:25.530
I can go looking for Noah!

08:30.770 --> 08:32.570
Thanks for your business.

08:34.110 --> 08:39.410
Your store smells as good as the rumors say.

08:39.410 --> 08:40.820
Master Zico!

08:40.820 --> 08:43.380
You seem to be doing good business too.

08:43.380 --> 08:45.690
Yes, thank you.

08:45.690 --> 08:46.890
Master Zico!

08:46.890 --> 08:48.990
Would you like to come in and have some bread?

08:48.990 --> 08:51.060
It's fresh out of the oven!

08:51.060 --> 08:54.360
I've been waiting to hear those words.

08:55.900 --> 08:57.690
Let's see now...

09:00.500 --> 09:01.500
Tasty!

09:01.500 --> 09:02.400
Isn't it?

09:02.400 --> 09:03.870
Thank you.
Isn't it?

09:04.370 --> 09:06.340
This warmth...

09:06.340 --> 09:08.640
It's the very taste of peace.

09:08.640 --> 09:15.110
I hope the day will come when we can
all eat bread like this anytime.

09:17.590 --> 09:21.190
Yes, it's really quite good.

09:21.190 --> 09:25.150
My late mother taught me how to bake this bread.

09:26.090 --> 09:30.720
When I was small,
I baked bread with her almost every day.

09:32.170 --> 09:36.500
So, your mother was a good cook, huh?

09:36.500 --> 09:38.470
Yeah...

09:38.470 --> 09:39.470
How about you, Zed?

09:39.470 --> 09:42.810
What was your mother like?

09:42.810 --> 09:45.710
Did she have a specialty dish?

09:45.710 --> 09:48.650
Don't know, can't remember.

09:48.650 --> 09:51.590
You don't have to be so shy about it!

09:51.590 --> 09:53.320
She must have had at least one.

09:53.320 --> 09:56.060
There's got to be a dish that makes you think,
"Yep, this is Mom's home cooking. "

09:56.060 --> 09:57.690
Lay off!

09:57.690 --> 10:00.320
I told you I don't remember.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.590
Zed...

10:09.970 --> 10:13.600
Lady Sagiri, your meal is ready.

10:14.810 --> 10:16.680
Lady Sagiri?

10:16.680 --> 10:18.300
Lady Sagiri?!

10:39.730 --> 10:42.270
I'm sorry about earlier.

10:42.270 --> 10:46.240
Of course, there's some stuff
you don't want to tell.

10:46.240 --> 10:48.210
I'm really sorry.

10:48.610 --> 10:52.570
No, it's not like I'm hiding it.

10:53.480 --> 10:59.450
I just really don't know what kind
of person my mom is.

10:59.450 --> 11:01.750
What do you mean, you don't know?

11:03.320 --> 11:05.660
I have no idea.

11:05.660 --> 11:11.620
Mom's been in a hospital bed
ever since I can remember.

11:18.270 --> 11:23.310
I feel like Mom's heart was
always somewhere else.

11:23.310 --> 11:28.150
I wonder if she was ever even looking at me?

11:28.150 --> 11:29.780
Oh...

11:31.320 --> 11:35.450
But there's something I understand even less.

11:46.130 --> 11:49.930
Mom was a shard caster.

11:50.940 --> 11:55.980
So, does that mean your mom
was from this world?

11:55.980 --> 11:57.510
Don’t know...

11:57.510 --> 11:59.150
What about your father, then?

11:59.150 --> 12:01.550
I don't know!

12:01.550 --> 12:04.650
The only thing in my memory is the
image of my mom in a bed,

12:04.650 --> 12:08.860
staring at a fish tank all day long.

12:08.860 --> 12:10.020
Zed...

12:10.020 --> 12:12.490
I've been looking all over for you two!

12:13.460 --> 12:15.300
Master Sebastian!

12:15.300 --> 12:19.770
A child from the Seekers wants to see you two.

12:19.770 --> 12:21.170
Seekers?

12:21.170 --> 12:23.600
Some girl named Sagiri.

12:23.600 --> 12:25.710
What?! Sagiri?!

12:25.710 --> 12:27.500
So, she's alive?

12:37.750 --> 12:42.720
The Seekers, too, have finally seen
the birth of our savior.

12:42.720 --> 12:44.560
We can breathe a bit easier now.

12:44.560 --> 12:46.530
Congratulations.

12:47.830 --> 12:49.200
Sara...

12:49.200 --> 12:53.330
You currently possess two key spirits, correct?

12:54.070 --> 12:55.570
Yes...

12:55.570 --> 12:57.510
Pronimo and Monadi...

12:57.510 --> 13:03.140
What do you intend to do with them?

13:04.110 --> 13:06.910
I will protect them so that they do not
come into Tuskan hands,

13:06.910 --> 13:11.120
and their great powers are not used for evil,

13:11.120 --> 13:14.750
because that was his wish.

13:23.630 --> 13:26.630
As for the other key spirits...

13:26.630 --> 13:29.200
One of them is probably in Tusk now,

13:29.200 --> 13:31.310
so that leaves Sachura.

13:31.310 --> 13:33.270
Master Genm, something terrible has happened!

13:33.270 --> 13:34.510
What is it?

13:34.510 --> 13:37.850
I took my eyes off Lady Sagiri for a moment,
and she shifted somewhere!

13:37.850 --> 13:39.280
What?!

13:39.280 --> 13:41.580
Then, where is she now?

13:41.580 --> 13:43.650
She seems to have gone to Templar.

13:43.650 --> 13:45.350
What?

13:45.350 --> 13:50.090
What in the world is Lady Sagiri thinking?

13:50.090 --> 13:52.260
Please leave it to me.

13:52.260 --> 13:55.000
I will bring Lady Sagiri back here.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.290
Yes, I count on you.

14:01.940 --> 14:06.070
Is it true that you have come from the Seekers?

14:06.070 --> 14:09.980
The Seekers have long been a group
only heard of in legend.

14:09.980 --> 14:14.010
Everything about them is a mystery to us.

14:14.010 --> 14:15.450
Please tell us.

14:15.450 --> 14:17.920
Who are the Seekers?

14:17.920 --> 14:19.390
What is their aim?

14:19.390 --> 14:22.120
We don't even know where their territory is.

14:22.120 --> 14:24.690
Just what do they have in mind?

14:24.690 --> 14:26.320
Speak!

14:27.090 --> 14:29.300
I think that's about enough.

14:29.300 --> 14:30.920
Sagiri!

14:31.800 --> 14:33.430
Roya!

14:33.870 --> 14:36.840
Sagiri, you're alive.

14:36.840 --> 14:38.870
I'm so glad!

14:38.870 --> 14:40.500
Sagiri...

14:44.910 --> 14:48.040
Now, you be sure to get the
information out of her.

14:51.620 --> 14:54.290
It's okay now, Sagiri.

14:54.290 --> 14:56.060
Roya...

14:56.060 --> 14:58.020
I missed you!

14:59.060 --> 15:00.690
Sagiri...

15:01.400 --> 15:04.770
What are you doing in Templar?

15:04.770 --> 15:07.270
Zed, look for Noah!

15:07.270 --> 15:09.240
Look for him with me!

15:23.750 --> 15:25.350
Come on, please!

15:25.350 --> 15:26.820
Help me look for Noah!

15:26.820 --> 15:31.780
So, you two weren't together, then?

15:33.130 --> 15:34.560
Then, where is he?

15:34.560 --> 15:36.930
That's why I'm saying let's look!

15:36.930 --> 15:40.230
But we don't have any leads.

15:40.230 --> 15:43.670
Well then, we can look in Neotopia
and Zymot and Tusk...

15:43.670 --> 15:46.370
We can just look in all of them!

15:46.370 --> 15:47.940
Every last one of them, everywhere!

15:47.940 --> 15:49.680
Don't be ridiculous.

15:49.680 --> 15:51.300
Zed!

15:51.750 --> 15:54.870
Calm down, Sagiri, okay?

15:57.790 --> 15:59.050
What's that?!

15:59.050 --> 16:00.250
What happened?

16:00.250 --> 16:02.050
What's going on?!

16:04.190 --> 16:05.290
A spirit!

16:05.290 --> 16:07.090
Is the Tuskan army attacking?!

16:08.060 --> 16:09.930
Who the hell are you?!

16:09.930 --> 16:11.100
A woman?

16:11.100 --> 16:13.300
Did she come to attack us all by herself?

16:13.300 --> 16:15.100
Capture her!

16:25.710 --> 16:27.510
Don't let her escape!

16:55.180 --> 16:57.640
Damn it, she's so strong!

16:58.550 --> 17:00.680
Who the hell is she?

17:00.680 --> 17:03.480
If you don't want to die, get out of my way.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.220
Don't let her intimidate you!

17:05.220 --> 17:07.020
She's just one woman!

17:08.360 --> 17:10.390
Oh no! She's opened a hole in the castle wall!

17:10.390 --> 17:12.190
Hold her back with your spirits!

17:40.390 --> 17:42.690
It's been a long time...

17:43.820 --> 17:45.450
...Sara.

17:45.860 --> 17:47.490
Zico!

17:47.860 --> 17:53.160
I've always thought we would meet again.

18:23.730 --> 18:26.730
You're still playing that damn thing?

18:26.730 --> 18:28.370
A pathetic waste!

18:28.370 --> 18:31.710
You hardly ever even attend council meetings.

18:31.710 --> 18:34.270
Have some awareness of your position!

18:34.270 --> 18:37.070
You're one of the four generals of Tusk!

18:38.250 --> 18:42.150
Not because I particularly want to be.

18:42.150 --> 18:45.550
Put yourself in my shoes for a second.

18:45.550 --> 18:50.010
To gain Tusker's power, I need your power!

18:51.830 --> 18:58.730
Do you still think we need Tusker's power
to stop the degeneration of this country

18:58.730 --> 19:02.190
and make it flourish, brother?

19:03.070 --> 19:04.870
That talk again?

19:11.480 --> 19:15.780
You just keep your mouth shut
and do what I tell you.

19:20.190 --> 19:21.810
Damn it...

19:24.490 --> 19:27.260
What is it you're after?

19:27.260 --> 19:30.890
Why have you come to this land
after all this time?

19:32.200 --> 19:33.770
Is it Zed?

19:33.770 --> 19:36.240
Did you come to see Zed?

19:36.240 --> 19:39.360
Or no, perhaps you came for Amir Gaul?

19:39.770 --> 19:41.010
Good question.

19:41.010 --> 19:45.140
Perhaps I came to kill you.

19:46.110 --> 19:50.350
So, you do still bear a grudge against me, then?

19:50.350 --> 19:53.890
No, actually I'm grateful to you.

19:53.890 --> 19:57.690
You guided me to become a shard caster.

20:17.740 --> 20:19.980
Where am I?

20:19.980 --> 20:21.780
Who are you?

20:21.780 --> 20:25.320
You have been chosen by Amir Gaul.

20:25.320 --> 20:30.960
Your great power shall save this world.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.760
Rejoice.

20:33.990 --> 20:36.960
Forgive us, woman from another world.

20:37.530 --> 20:39.500
Another world?

20:41.030 --> 20:43.330
Could this place be...

21:29.380 --> 21:31.120
What's the matter, Sara?

21:31.120 --> 21:34.750
You won't even be able to call
Amir Gaul at this rate!

21:36.090 --> 21:37.890
Yes, master.

21:39.290 --> 21:41.600
Believe more in your own power.

21:41.600 --> 21:44.890
You have been chosen by Amir Gaul!

21:59.850 --> 22:05.310
Zico, I'll give you a chance to learn
that I'm different now!

22:07.120 --> 22:09.890
That key spirit is Monadi.

22:09.890 --> 22:12.460
So, you're the one who took it.

22:12.460 --> 22:14.090
Old man!

22:24.870 --> 22:26.500
Mom...

22:39.620 --> 22:44.920
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
Habatakitakatta dake

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
Mou kodomo ja nai no ni to

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
Nando jibun o shikatta darou

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
Yakusoku sareta basho made

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Hitasura susumu dake sa

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Bokura no tsubasa wa

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Honmono no totemo totemo kirei na hane dakara

23:24.000 --> 23:33.740
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
Tooku e tooku e hitasura tobun da

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
Hora mou kaze ni natte

23:49.560 --> 23:57.930
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
Sekai no hate made

24:17.650 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Truth Made Known

24:17.650 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Truth Made Known"
